Sample [SimTalk]
Makes the TimeSequence designated by <Path> record data periodically (true) or watch data, i.e., records
them only when its value changes (false).
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.Sample:boolean
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type boolean.
Example
ts.Sample := true
See also
Mode [drop-down list] - TimeSequence
Sample [SimTalk]
